  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**What people actually did, from the audit log itself.**\n\nRead from Postgres rather than from metrics, because these questions are high-cardinality by nature \u2014 every action, every tenant, every actor \u2014 and a metric label per actor would be unbounded. The `obs.*` views are read by a role whose entire world is those views."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Actions (24h)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "dcms-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "postgres",
            "uid": "dcms-postgres"
          },
          "rawSql": "SELECT sum(events) AS value FROM obs.v_tenant_activity_daily WHERE day >= now() - interval '1 day'",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
